== Effects ==
* Adds 0.04 [[damage]] for every {{e|Penny|text=coin}} Isaac has.
** The damage caps at +3.96 Damage at 99 coins.
** Though Isaac can still collect coins if he already has 99, he will not gain any damage bonus from them.

== Synergies ==
* {{dlc+|r}}{{i|Deep Pockets}}: Increases maximum damage bonus from Money = Power. The damage caps at +39.96 Damage at 999 coins.{{dlc-}}
* {{i|A Dollar}}: Immediately maxes out damage bonus.
* {{i|A Quarter}}: Increases damage by 1 per 25 coins.
* {{I|Greed's Gullet}}: Isaac will gain health and damage.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Diplopia}}: Damage bonus doesn't stack.
* {{i|Spindown Dice}}: Turns into {{i|The Wafer}} when rerolled.

