== Trivia ==
* The name of the item is a reference to the popular saying "Money is power".
* This item is used in {{chal|PAY TO PLAY}}.
* For a few weeks, a hidden message under Money = Power's icon in the game's files read "where are you".
** The message was part of an [https://imgur.com/V2l5TaN alternate reality game] and could be seen on the collection page, representing Isaac asking for his father.
* In the original ''The Binding of Isaac'', Money = Power was unlocked by beating {{e|Mom's Heart}} eight times.

